Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't have a ghost of a chance beating\NKaiba because this time he is a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Kimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Two witnesses saw him fall to his doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take back what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left of\NKaiba are your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.85,0:01:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus a very cranky ghost just\Nlooking for revenge. It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel with the ghoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's nothing but a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A trick by Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll find your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.57,0:01:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is extremely entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.05,0:01:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just love reality TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.21,0:01:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Yugi dueling?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.73,0:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's left of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor boy had shown so much promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But now he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:01:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't take all the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I had help from Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now to return the favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach him a lesson about\Nthe real power of the Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you look like you've\Nseen a ghost. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no longer of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have had it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you beat me, you\Ntook more than just the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole my life and destroyed my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but an imposter, so\Nstop the lies and let's start the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This time you won't beat my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You might look like Kaiba, but there\Nis no way you can imitate his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean my deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but a fake! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That ghost don't even look like Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I mean, it's not a\Nghost and it's not Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.67,0:03:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Yugi, I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can sense my thoughts, and\NI know that you can see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kaiba, but this time you're dueling\Nsomeone who's got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, once I beat Yugi, Pegasus\Ncan have Kaiba Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Three stars says I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That means when the duel's\Ndone, I'll have six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll start off with\Nthe Hitatsumi Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn to move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hitatsumi Giant is how\NKaiba began our last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a card just like\Nthat in my brother's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just because it's the same card\Ndoesn't mean it's the same deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's tried to confuse me by making\Nthe same opening move that Kaiba did,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but it'll have the same result.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.45,0:04:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start with this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Dark Magician with an\Nattack strength of 2,500!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark magic attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as strong as ever, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That carbon copy Kaiba is laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny how things have\Ncome full circle, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking in that\Nfeeble brain of yours right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to the conclusion that no\Nmatter what, there's no way you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And you couldn't be more right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:05:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a simpleton like you now\Nknows that I must be Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you accept that fact,\Nyou may as well accept defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to lose to me just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi, you barely beat\Nme the last time we dueled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time your big advantage is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost Exodia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only beat me with Exodia in your\Ndeck, and without it, you can only lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.69,0:05:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Never guessed that you'll be dressed\Nin my clothes and in my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:06:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody could survive a fall like that\NCouldn't wait to move right in If I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be concerned So here's where you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Going? Bet you didn't count on my return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were so dumb. You
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,had it all under control Now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing's enough Gonna take\Nback what you stole Give it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.49,0:06:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,cause now I'm back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to us now. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Running identity verification protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please state your name. Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd seen it all, but\Nhaven't to break into your own house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too long a story for right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Too long a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I'm not in such a\Ntalkative mood myself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were off gallivanting, a hostile\Ntakeover of Kaiba Corporation has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus kicked off his Duel\NMonsters Championship at the Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi Moto can be defeated by Pegasus,\Nor a competitor that represents him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,then the new Kaiba Corporation board\Nhas promised him control of the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.87,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His deck has Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia, obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:08:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, sometime after you\Nlost to Yugi, he lost Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When it rains, it pours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus knows all about the\Ncorporation bylaws that require
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,a living Khyber heir to make\Nany change of control legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.11,0:08:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Moguva's his prisoner, and\Nwith you out of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it's likely Pegasus\Nwill exert all kinds of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,pressure to make your\Nbrother do what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.45,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll keep my brother safe, at\Nleast until the takeover's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've gotta make sure Pegasus doesn't\Ndefeat Yugi in a duel, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna give up Kaiba\NCorporation without a real fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Takeover Time by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.15,0:08:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to hack right into\NPegasus' computer mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next stop, the Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to play head\Ngames or duel monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's gonna blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This next card's a blast\Nfrom the past, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With the emphasis on blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.79,0:09:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I attack with the Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one deck has got that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That means what they\Nsay. Could it be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the advantage\Nis mine. So this really
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Kaiba's deck. There's\Nno other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But does that mean that Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba is really. Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:10:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi My feelings weren't hurt when you\Ncalled me a liar Now admit that you are wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not having a real body\Nisn't so bad. You would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,believe what I save in food\Nbills alone But I still get to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the finer things in life.\NLike revenge. And I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to savor its sweet taste for\Na very long time Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, someone make him go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost breaks my heart if I add one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we've easily broken\Nthrough the duelist kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,computer system too easy okay\Nwhen it comes to computer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,duels pegasus has met his\Nmatch now it should be a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.89,0:10:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,piece of cake to find the\Nfield in which Yugi is dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking, I'm looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found the security\Nand it's all around Yugi's data.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.71,0:11:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and give it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a computer system anywhere\Non Earth that I can't break into.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.79,0:11:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Every computer has a back door\Nif you know where to look, and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess where we're gonna look.\NIt'll be quicker if I take over on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,manual for a while data from all\Nthe duels is being beamed from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the island to an orbiting industrial\Nillusion satellite and back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,down to their mainframe these\Ntransmissions are obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,highly encrypted if we can somehow\Nforce the industrial illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,computer offline i'm sure their\Nbackup systems won't have as much
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,security are you saying we can make\Ntheir computer crash From here? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A computer crash is\Nexactly what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest computer crash ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to use Pegasus'\Nown satellite to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've already tried to\Nhack into their systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My idea's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the security is down, we should\Nbe able to freely access the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready with a search\Nfor the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Inquiry\Nloaded and standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi's dueling, he's\Nsure to use that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So spill it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.73,0:12:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck are we\Ngoing to use Industrial
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusion's own satellite to\Nbring down their computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,By bringing down the satellite itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Down all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Loading satellite schematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Class Triton series.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Booster rocket controls online.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Locating orbital coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Reaching onboard computer security.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now the proud owner of an\NIndustrial Illusions satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now plot a crash course\Nfor the computer mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uploading new coordinates now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We are locked on target for the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Virus software won't stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, you're on notice that the\NKaiba Corporation's still mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Satellite impact in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't attack just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why rush to victory when I can draw\Nit out as long as possible instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hiding some sort of\Nmagic card. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, go to defensive mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I summon Curse of Dragon\Non the defense as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart playing, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it wasn't smart enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You played right into my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, now all your monster cards on the\Nfield have been switched into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,While that defense paralysis\Ncard's on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,my monsters can't defend themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to think of a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon,\Nuse your White Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for your\NCurse of Dragon. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No Dark Magician there. Next field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.15,0:15:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We've exhausted almost every\Npossibility of locating Yugi Moto. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Field 146 is the final act of duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he's got to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Search field 146.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.33,0:15:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter field 146.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm frozen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.57,0:15:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse this time. Hang on. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.29,0:15:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That means just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for Yugi's\Ncards activates the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But the security door...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come this far already,\Nand I'm not gonna blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, yes I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a virtual fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensors indicate that all of the data\Nfrom Yu-Gi's duels is processed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't blow your\Nway through this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's impossible to\Npenetrate without the password.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a password.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I know Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,that egomaniac would\Nnever think that anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,would outsmart him and get even this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The password?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I defeat his\Nblue-eyes white dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you gotta admit, for a\Nstiff, this Kaiba sure got game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:16:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you know that's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks he's a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know my brother, and\Nhe's not mean like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my best friend in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.67,0:17:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be as sure as you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing I do know for sure,\Nthis duel's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.43,0:17:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical hats, conceal the dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's under there somewhere, but which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you so desperate that you have your\Ndark magician doing simple hat tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a trick, and it's not so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, but you better\Nthink twice before you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Four hats, only 25 % chance\Nyou'll find the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The real question is, what else\Nis hiding beneath those hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.59,0:17:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that's what I like to\Ncall pulling one out of your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right about the password.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Virtual Fortress is unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We now have access to Yugi's\Ndata, and it was just his turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus thinks he can make up\Nall the rules in this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but he could never have\Nimagined this brand new twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where the Dark Magician hides.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so sure, then move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame this duel's\Ngoing to end so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,White Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If he attacks the right hat, I'll lose\Nmore than just this duel. Much more!
